From: manishbazz <manishbazz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 19:51:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add About tab: bio, location, favorite/live song widget,
 mechanical line art
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New 'about' panel added to PANEL_IDS after 'contact' — nav, hash
  routing, keyboard/swipe nav, and panel-width layout are all driven
  generically off PANEL_IDS.length, so this needed no changes there
- content/site.yaml: added location (Chandigarh, India), bio paragraphs
  (from the provided text), a favoriteSong placeholder, and an unset
  spotifyStatusUrl
- NowPlaying.tsx: polls an optional JSON endpoint every 30s for a live
  now-playing status, falling back to the static favoriteSong when
  unset/unreachable. Documented clearly in the file why true live data
  needs an external serverless proxy — GitHub Pages can't hold Spotify
  API secrets securely, so this can't be 100% self-contained in this
  repo without exposing credentials
- MechanicalDecor.tsx: hand-built line-art gears (SVG, rotating via
  CSS) plus faint incompressible Navier-Stokes + continuity equations
  as background texture, fitting the CFD/CAD background
- AboutPanel ties it together with the scrambled 'About' heading,
  matching existing panel conventions
